      "blurb": "Shoton: Crystal Dragon",
      "summonRole": "Crystal Dragon",
      "biography": "<p><em>Shoton Hijutsu (an Earthen Artifact).</em> It uses your highest jutsu attack bonus or Save DC when an effect calls for it. You command it as a Bonus action.</p><p><strong>Large Construct, unaligned.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 22 + 2 For every rank above A-Rank, <strong>DR</strong> 6 +2 for every rank above A-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 80 + 20 for every rank above A-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 40 ft fly. STR +6 (save +9), DEX +2 (+5), CON +9 (+9), INT −5, WIS +0, CHA +5 (−5). <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Bludgeoning, Piercing and Slashing. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Sensory, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 60 ft.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC, DR and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your highest jutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
    },
